    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a generic species in the ecosystem. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="class_species" kindref="compound">Species</ref> class encapsulates common properties of all species, including a unique identifier, a scientific name, growth information, and extinction status. It serves as a base class for more specialized species types such as animals and resources. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
